    Bug 1964284 - Do not save message database for removed newsgroup.r=mkmelin


    - Prevent calling `NntpNewsGroup.cleanUp` after a newsgroup has just been removed by auto-unsubscribe.
    - Instead of the raw group name, use the news folder name for auto-unsubscribe.
    - Remove unused properties from `nsINntpIncomingServer`.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D247708

